        "Title": "You&apos;re &apos;Fired&apos;",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ICA_FACILITY_SHIP",
        "PublicId": "199596215362",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/TheFacility/_Scene_Mission_Polarbear_Module_002_B.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository af589e83-295e-48f0-92a2-0065ff201f07).Image",
        "Description": "The ICA has purchased some new shiny firearms for their &apos;craftsmen&apos; to use. Unfortunately, these weapons were so expensive the ICA now can no longer pay all of its training actors.\r\rDeciding whom to fire was easy; a few actors were already called up before for underperformance. Since these weapons also need to be tested before field use, why don&apos;t you try it on them during today&apos;s rehearsal?\r\rWe&apos;re dealing with live ammunition, and show time&apos;s tomorrow, so make sure you don&apos;t harm anyone else.",
